    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Night at the Lake</strong></i> is a first-person atmospheric psychological horror where you play as a guard working at a remote lake. Every evening, you patrol the area, fill out reports, and make sure no one stays behind after dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, strange and unsettling things begin to happen. You encounter eerie events, disturbing discoveries, and a growing feeling that someone \u2014 or something \u2014 is watching you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear but tense narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive atmosphere of solitude and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of the lakeside area and interaction with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the unsettling quiet of the night, occasionally broken by something sinister.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Night at the Lake</strong></i> is a first-person atmospheric psychological horror where you play as a guard working at a remote lake. Every evening, you patrol the area, fill out reports, and make sure no one stays behind after dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, strange and unsettling things begin to happen. You encounter eerie events, disturbing discoveries, and a growing feeling that someone \u2014 or something \u2014 is watching you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear but tense narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive atmosphere of solitude and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of the lakeside area and interaction with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the unsettling quiet of the night, occasionally broken by something sinister.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A night shift at a remote lake turns into something unsettling. Explore the area, log data, and uncover what lurks in the darkness.",
